@startuml
title SplitSmart Use Cases (proposed)
left to right direction
actor User
actor Organizer
actor Approver
rectangle "SplitSmart product" {
 usecase "Register, verify, sign in\nand recover account" as Auth
 usecase "Manage group\nand membership" as Group
 usecase "Submit expense\nand receipt" as Submit
 usecase "Review / approve\nor reject expense" as Review
 usecase "View balances\nand payment history" as Balance
 usecase "Record partial/full\nsettlement" as Pay
 usecase "Receive expense notice" as Notice
 usecase "View summaries\nand date-range reports" as Report
}
User --> Auth
User --> Submit
User --> Balance
User --> Pay
User --> Notice
User --> Report
Organizer --> Group
Approver --> Review
note bottom
Use cases describe required behavior; service and UI are proposed.
Swing desktop use does not satisfy web/Android/iOS coverage.
end note
@enduml
